# IntraCore: параметры HAL блока из базы STM32CubeMX (db/mcu/IP/*_Modes.xml).
# Порождено tools/hal_import — руками не править. Формат: src/Docs/Description/HalCatalogFormat.md
[Ip]
Name=TOUCHSENSING
Version=v2_2_4_Cube

[Parameters]
# имя|подпись|группа|единица|мин|макс|описание
TOUCHSENSING_VERSION|TouchSensing version|Version and modes||||
TOUCHSENSING_APP_MEM_POOL_SIZE|TouchSensing memory pool size|Memory Configuration||512|262144|Default memory pool size for the TouchSensing application.
TOUCHSENSING_MODE|TouchSensing acquisition mode|Version and modes||||Software or hardware acquisition
TSLPRM_TOTAL_CHANNELS_DEFAULT|TSLPRM_TOTAL_CHANNELS_DEFAULT|Summary||1|+TSC:Gx_IOx-Channel|Formula calculation for TSLPRM_TOTAL_CHANNELS default value.
TSLPRM_TOTAL_CHANNELS|TSLPRM_TOTAL_CHANNELS|Summary||1|255|Total number of channels in application (range=1..24) One TouchKey: one channel One LinRot: 3, 4, 5 or 6 channels depending of selected one Be aware that if your TSC is not correctly configured, i.e. not enough channels activated then you will get error message because of this.
TSLPRM_TOTAL_ALL_TOUCHKEYS|TSLPRM_TOTAL_ALL_TOUCHKEYS|Summary||0|=TSC_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|Total number of touchkeys, maximum being nbr of activated channels in TSC IP
TSLPRM_TOTAL_ALL_LINROTS|TSLPRM_TOTAL_ALL_LINROTS|Summary||0|24|Total number of touchkeys, maximum 24
TSC_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|TSC_ACTIVE_CHANNELS = max(TSLPRM_TOTAL_CHANNELS)|Summary||||USER INFORMATION: Total number of channels in application activated on TSC IP TSLPRM_TOTAL_CHANNELS cannot be higher
TSLPRM_TOTAL_BANKS|TSLPRM_TOTAL_BANKS|Summary||0|255|Total number of banks in application (range=1..255) 3 channels per bank
TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|Summary||0|+TSC:Gx_IOx-Channel|Formula calculation for TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_ACTIVE_CHANNELS default value.
TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_MAX|TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_MAX|Summary||0|0|Formula calculation for TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_MAX default value.
TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_B_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_B_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|Summary||0|+TSC:Gx_IOx-Channel|Formula calculation for TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_B_ACTIVE_CHANNELS default value.
TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_B_MAX|TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_B_MAX|Summary||0|0|Formula calculation for TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_B_MAX default value.
TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS|TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS|TouchKey sensors||0|255|Total number of "Extended" TouchKeys in application
IO_TOUCHKEY1|IO_TOUCHKEY1|TouchKey sensors||||TouchKey IO n°1
TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_B|TSLPRM_TOTAL_TOUCHKEYS_B|TouchKey sensors||0|255|Total number of "Basic" TouchKeys in application
IO_TOUCHKEY_B1|IO_TOUCHKEY_B1|TouchKey sensors||||TouchKey B IO n°1
TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1|TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1|Linear/Rotary sensors used||||Select which Linear and Rotary sensors you use in your application. <font color="red"> <b>Warning</b>: it is recommended to activate IO's in 3 groups of TS/TSC peripheral for optimized performances </font> - 0 = Not Used - 1 = Used LIN = Linear sensor M1 = Mono electrodes design with 0/255 position at extremities of the sensor
TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_NBR_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_NBR_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|Summary||0|+TSC:Gx_IOx-Channel|Formula calculation for TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_NBR_ACTIVE_CHANNELS default value.
TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_NBR|TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_NBR|Linear/Rotary sensors used||0|=IF((TSC_ACTIVE_CHANNELS - TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_NBR_ACTIVE_CHANNELS) > -1,FLOOR((TSC_ACTIVE_CHANNELS -TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_NBR_ACTIVE_CHANNELS)/3),0)|Number of TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1 Extended type
TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_B_NBR_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_B_NBR_ACTIVE_CHANNELS|Summary||0|+TSC:Gx_IOx-Channel|Formula calculation for TSLPRM_USE_3CH_LIN_M1_B_NBR_ACTIVE_CHANNELS default value.
